<li>
<p><strong>参数</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><code>func</code> (<a href="/nonebot2/version-2.4.2/api/typing.html#T-EventPreProcessor" target="_blank">T_EventPreProcessor</a>)</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
